# Format After Code Generation

After creating or modifying code, run formatters before finishing so CI passes.

## Frontend (`frontend/`)

```bash
cd frontend && npx biome check --write .
```

Verify with:

```bash
cd frontend && npx biome check .
```

## Backend (`backend/`)

```bash
cd backend && dotnet format Timesheets.slnx
```

Verify with:

```bash
cd backend && dotnet format Timesheets.slnx --verify-no-changes
```

Apply this in the same turn as the code changes — do not leave formatting for the user.
